---
description: |
  Updates an OSINT lookup table from OCSF OSINT Inventory Info events.

  Declare the lookup table in your configuration. A `write-timeout` ages out
  indicators that the feed stops reporting:

  ```yaml
  # contexts/ocsf-osint.yaml
  type: lookup-table
  persist-interval: 5min
  write-timeout: 30d
  ```

  A removed indicator replaces its entry with one that expires immediately,
  which `tenzir::osint::enrich` ignores.
args:
  named:
    - name: context_name
      type: string
      default: ocsf-osint
      description: Lookup-table context to update.
---

where @name == "ocsf.osint_inventory_info"
unroll osint
// Contexts can't erase entries. Expiring the entry retracts the indicator.
if status_id? == 99 and status? == "Removed" {
  osint.expiration_time = now()
}
context_update $context_name, key=osint.value, value=osint
